          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Al-Hasan ibn Al-Jahm has been transmitted by me from Muhammad ibn Ali Majilawayh - may Allah (swt) be pleased with him - from Ali ibn Ibrahim ibn Hashim, from his father, from Al-Hasan ibn Al-Jahm."
        ]
      }
